# Copy to `.env` (gitignored). Fill values; do not commit them.
# Names below are the ones the engine reads. DECODEO-*, DECODEDOCS_*, and
# hyphenated keys are never looked up.
#
# Generate the two console exports with:
#   pnpm farsyn server hash <password>

# ── Console (`pnpm dev` / `farsyn server`) ───────────────────────────────
# Required. `hash` prints both. The hash is pbkdf2, not the password itself.
FARSYN_ADMIN_PASSWORD_HASH=
FARSYN_SESSION_SECRET=
# Optional. Bearer token for machine clients (32+ characters).
# FARSYN_API_TOKEN=

# ── Residential egress (Decodo / any HTTP proxy) ─────────────────────────
# Most specific wins: FARSYN_PROXY_<MARKET> → FARSYN_PROXY_<COUNTRY> → this.
# Placeholders the engine substitutes: {country} {countryLower} {city}
# {cityLower} {market} {session} {sessionduration}.
# Password lives in this URL. There is no FARSYN_PROXY_PASSWORD.
# Decodo usernames are letters, digits and underscore. A hyphen is a
# parameter delimiter and 407s as a wrong password. There is no
# DECODEO_PASSWORD — the password lives in this URL only.
#
# Also set network.provider to http-proxy in farsyn.config.json (or pass
# --provider http-proxy). The default is direct, which ignores these.
FARSYN_PROXY_TEMPLATE=http://user-USER-country-{countryLower}-city-{cityLower}-session-{session}-sessionduration-{sessionduration}:PASSWORD@gate.decodo.com:10001
# Optional sticky-session length in minutes. Default 10.
# FARSYN_SESSION_DURATION=10
# Optional overrides, comma-separated pools allowed:
# FARSYN_PROXY_NO=
# FARSYN_PROXY_OSLO=

# ── Quota (per tenant) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Usage API. Without both, traffic is unmeasurable, not unlimited.
DECODO_API_KEY=
# Value is the Decodo sub-account username. The NAME of this variable is
# whatever inputs/tenants/<id>.yaml lists as proxySubUser for that tenant.
# FARSYN_SUBUSER_<TENANT>=

# ── GitHub issues (watch + findings file) ────────────────────────────────
# Token and repo required to file. Absent means the sweep still finishes
# and nothing is opened. Urgent label is applied for Decodo / hung runs.
# FARSYN_GITHUB_TOKEN=
# FARSYN_GITHUB_REPO=owner/name
# FARSYN_CONSOLE_URL=https://farsyn.example
# Site findings file on the host's repo from inputs/tenants/<id>.yaml
# `repositories:`. Instrumentation always uses FARSYN_GITHUB_REPO.

# ── Daily digest (farsyn digest send / farsyn-digest.timer) ──────────────
# From inbox is FARSYN_LOGIN_EMAIL. One of --to or FARSYN_DIGEST_TO is
# required — there is no operator default.
# FARSYN_DIGEST_TO=ops@example.com
# AGENTMAIL_API_KEY=
# FARSYN_LOGIN_EMAIL=

# ── Optional ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SERPAPI_KEY=
# FARSYN_CLAUDE_BIN=claude
# FARSYN_AGENT_BROWSER_BIN=
# AGENT_BROWSER_DASHBOARD_URL=
# TEMPORAL_ADDRESS=localhost:7233
# TEMPORAL_NAMESPACE=default
